# The retrofit machines (machine/retrofit) load and run. laser3015: a slow
# Y pass on the iron-core motors: friction (60 N, 0.58 A) and cogging
# (28 N) in the current, but no fight between Y1 and Y2: with the default
# current loop (cur_bw 1000) the bridge's yaw made them oscillate at
# 200 Hz, +-4 A; laser3015_y.conf sets cur_bw 2000.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/laser3015.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.5 750 1460
run 0.3
mark
move 4 750 1540
print max_cur_y1 max_cur_y2 fault_code
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 > 0.75
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 < 1.6
@expect portal.max_cur_y2 < 1.6
@expect portal.fault_code == 0
@reject ^ERROR
@reject bad line
